#
# JSON input-depth guard. serde_json enforces a built-in 128-level recursion
# limit (the `unbounded_depth` feature that could disable it is intentionally
# NOT enabled — see rust/Cargo.toml). A request body nested past that limit is
# rejected with HTTP 400 during parsing; the server does not stack-overflow.
#

